  "coverage_limit": "Typed-mapping library over the selected xmlparser tokenizer; its documented generic AnyElement view is the observed result. instant-xml resolves namespaces, decodes references and builds AnyElement itself. It consumes xmlns declarations without exposing them, so the summary has no namespace_declarations count and namespaces lists the URIs of expanded names. AnyElement keeps one text value per element (the last text node), so mixed content is not fully reported. It rejects a processing instruction inside the root element, so the second control is order-default-ns-no-pi.xml."
